            "label": "A research chat can become a coding chat from the AI itself",
            "text": "ask for an app, a script or a fix and it calls start_coding_mode — a client-side tool that exists only in ResearchEngine — which creates (or reuses) the project, moves your conversation into it without losing a message, and opens the worksp…"
